<title>USA: USAir adds new code share cities in Germany.</title>
<headline>USAir adds new code share cities in Germany.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USAir said Monday that it and German airline Deutsche BA were adding two new code share cities, Hamburg and Cologne/Bonn, effective March 5.</p>
<p>The carrier said the cities are in addition to its existing code share cities with Deutsche BA of Berlin and Duesseldorf.</p>
